                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.15s; height: 18px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.30s; height: 26px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.45s; height: 14px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.60s; height: 30px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.75s; height: 20px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.90s; height: 12px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: 0.00s; height: 28px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.15s; height: 22px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.30s; height: 16px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.45s; height: 30px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.60s; height: 24px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.75s; height: 12px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.90s; height: 18px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: 0.00s; height: 26px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.15s; height: 14px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.30s; height: 22px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.45s; height: 30px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.60s; height: 16px"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.75s; height: 10px"></span>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="align-self: flex-end; max-width: 86%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 18px 18px 6px 18px; background: #F58220; color: #06255A; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700">Je prends vos informations. Quelle est votre adresse ?</div>
                  <div style="align-self: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 18px 18px 18px 6px; background: #06255A">
                    <span style="flex: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7D92BF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
                      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#06255A" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M7 4l13 8-13 8z" />
                      </svg>
                    </span>
                    <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; height: 30px">
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: 0.00s; height: 10px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.20s; height: 16px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.40s; height: 30px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.60s; height: 22px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.80s; height: 14px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: 0.00s; height: 26px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.20s; height: 18px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.40s; height: 12px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.60s; height: 24px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.80s; height: 30px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: 0.00s; height: 16px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.20s; height: 22px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.40s; height: 28px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.60s; height: 12px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: -0.80s; height: 20px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                      <span class="wv" style="animation-delay: 0.00s; height: 30px; background: #7D92BF"></span>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="align-self: flex-end; max-width: 86%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 18px 18px 6px 18px; background: #F58220; color: #06255A; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 700">Merci. Je transmets l'urgence, on vous rappelle ce matin.</div>
