  </div>
</section>
<section id="details" style="font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 104px clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px); color: #06255A; background: #F3F6FC">
  <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; align-items: flex-start">
      <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #B45309; border: 1px solid #B45309; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px">Ce qu'elle fait pour vous</span>
      <h2 style="font-family: Satoshi,Inter,sans-serif; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 900px">Une réceptionniste qui <span style="color: #F58220">travaille à votre façon</span>.</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3E4F73; max-width: 700px">Une journée type : voilà ce qu'elle fait pour vous, de la veille jusqu'à la pause de midi.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px">
      <div class="cwrap" tabindex="0" style="position: relative; height: 620px; overflow: hidden; perspective: 1600px; outline-offset: 4px" aria-roledescription="carrousel" aria-label="Ce qu'elle fait pour vous" data-on-keydown="onKey">
        <div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 640px; height: 640px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245,130,32,0.20), rgba(245,130,32,0.06) 45%, transparent 68%); pointer-events: none"></div>
        <div class="cc" role="group" aria-roledescription="diapositive" aria-label="1 sur 6 : Elle travaille à votre façon" style="transform: translate(calc(-50% + 0px), -50%) scale(1.06) rotateY(0deg); opacity: 1; z-index: 10; cursor: default; pointer-events: auto; border: 2px solid #F58220; box-shadow: 0 34px 80px rgba(6,37,90,0.24), 0 0 0 8px rgba(245,130,32,0.14)" data-on-click="go0" data-bind="style:c0">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between">
            <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #B45309; background: #FFF1E3; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 12px">La veille</span>
            <span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; background: #F58220; color: #06255A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10" />
                <circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2" />
                <circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div style="box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 150px; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 18px; background: #F3F6FC; border: 1px solid #E3E9F4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 8px">
            <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5B6B8F">Vos réglages</span>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">
              <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ffffff; color: #06255A; border: 1px solid #DCE3F0">Lun–Ven · 7h–18h</span>
              <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ffffff; color: #06255A; border: 1px solid #DCE3F0">Zone : 30 km</span>
              <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ffffff; color: #06255A; border: 1px solid #DCE3F0">Urgences : oui</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
            <h3 style="font-family: Satoshi,Inter,sans-serif; margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 800; color: #06255A">Elle travaille à votre façon</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3E4F73">Vos horaires, vos zones, vos règles : elle répond avec ce que vous avez réglé, pas avec des phrases toutes faites.</p>
          </div>
          <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #5B6B8F">01 / 06</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cc" role="group" aria-roledescription="diapositive" aria-label="2 sur 6 : Elle répond aux appels" style="transform: translate(calc(-50% + 340px), -50%) scale(0.82) rotateY(-14deg); opacity: 0.55; z-index: 9; cursor: pointer; pointer-events: auto; filter: saturate(.8)" data-on-click="go1" data-bind="style:c1">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between">
            <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #B45309; background: #FFF1E3; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 12px">07:42</span>
            <span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; background: #F58220; color: #06255A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div style="box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 150px; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 18px; background: #F3F6FC; border: 1px solid #E3E9F4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 8px">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px">
