            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
            <h3 style="font-family: Satoshi,Inter,sans-serif; margin: 0; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 800; color: #06255A">Elle répond aux appels</h3>
